Questions to prepare for what opposing counsel might ask (or cross-examination topics)
- What facts are they likely to attack (dates, payments, credibility, parenting time, communications)?  
- What documents or statements of mine are they likely to use against me?  
- What weaknesses in my case do you expect them to target, and how should I respond?  
