- What proof will be persuasive? (lease, receipts, photos, repair requests, communications, code violation reports)  
- What deadlines apply for response to service and for the landlord to file for possession?  
- Can we ask for a continuance to gather evidence? How?  
- If I lose, what’s the eviction process/timeframe and what are my options for appeal or stay?  
- Will an eviction judgment affect my immigration case or custody case (ask attorney to confirm)?

