Questions to ask about logistics & costs
- What will this hearing cost (attorney time, filing fees, expert fees)? Are there cost-saving options?  
- How long do you expect to need to prepare before the hearing? What can I do to help prepare faster?  
- Do you recommend any immediate steps I should take (get records, contact witnesses, file motions)?

Sample phrasing you can use when talking with Maria Santos
- “Can you walk me through what the judge is most likely to focus on at the hearing and how we should prepare?”  
- “What questions do you expect opposing counsel to ask me, and can we role-play those so I answer clearly?”  
- “What documents do you need from me right away to support our case?”  
- “What are the worst realistic outcomes and our plan if that happens?”  
- “Will this outcome affect my immigration status or custody situation — if so, how?”

