  - A short email to Maria Santos summarizing urgent points and asking for actions (you can copy/paste it into your email).
  - A script of 10–15 practice Q&As for you to rehearse with suggested short answers.

Which of the above would be most helpful now — the email to Maria Santos, the one-page timeline template, or the practice Q&A script? Also please tell me the service date/deadline if you have it and whether these proceedings are in multiple courts so I can tailor the lists more exactly.

