1) Top questions to ask your attorney (bring to your meeting)
- What are the exact deadlines I must meet now (response filing, motions, disclosures)? Can any deadlines be extended and how?  
- What is our procedural posture and timeline until the next hearing/trial date? What filings will you make and when?  
