1) What will you file and when?
2) Which facts/documents are highest priority for me to produce?
3) Who should we call as witnesses and what will they say?
4) Do you recommend I testify? If so, can we do a mock prep session?
5) Any motions we should file now (continuance, dismissal, etc.)?
6) How do custody/eviction issues affect any immigration exposures (if applicable)?

Would you like me to draft this email and send it now?

Would you like me to draft a tailored list of questions and a one-minute hearing statement for your specific case? If so, tell me which case to focus on (eviction, custody, immigration) and any key facts (dates, notices, payments, safety concerns) and I’ll prepare a ready-to-send email to Maria or a hearing script.

